Z||000000||AusFiero||08-25-2001||11:36 PM||||I went to a swap meet today to see what was around. Picked up a few old car books and magazines. But the best scores were a late model Corvette style bonnet scoop for FREE. May cut it down and play around with it to be a rear deck scoop. But the best bit was the rear spoiler pictured below for only $40. It is just what I have been looking for for my Fiero. Once it has been adapted to fit I will probably sell them too. Does not need a great deal of work to make fit. Just trying to decide whether to leave the 3rd brake light in it, or 4th in this case.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wing1_3.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wing2_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
